OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to replace community kick
OL,4,Apitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Middleton are campaigning
OL,7,Ffor a replacement football pitch after
OL,8,Fplans were announced to turn the
OL,9,Fexisting site into a car park.
OL,11,FCampaigners say the pitch in Burnside
OL,12,FCrescent on the Langley Estate is a
OL,13,Fcommunity hub as well as somewhere
OL,14,Fpeople can play football and other
OL,15,Fsports.
OL,17,FThe pitch, which is next to the
OL,18,FBurnside Centre, is one of three on the
OL,19,Festate, and the car park will be for
OL,20,Fthe centre.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
