OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to replace community kick
OL,4,Apitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies say they have been told
OL,7,Freplacement facilities will be provided
OL,8,Fat Rochdale AFC and Rochdale Council's
OL,9,Fplanned Football and Community
OL,10,FWellbeing Hub at Bowlee Playing Fields.
OL,11,FBut they are campaigning for the new
OL,12,Fpitch to be created on land next to the
OL,13,Foriginal.
